@moduledoc """
The landing page's waitlist: who left an email address, and where they came
from (the `utm_*` parameters and the referrer of their first visit).

Anyone can join (`<%= inspect(@web) %>.WaitlistController`); only platform admins read the
list, at `/admin/waitlist` and as CSV at `/admin/waitlist.csv`.
"""

use Ash.Domain, otp_app: <%= inspect(@app) %>

resources do
  resource <%= inspect(@prefix) %>.Waitlist.Signup
end
